","vod_tv":"","vod_weekday":"","vod_area":"丹麦 \/ 塞尔维亚","vod_lang":"丹麦语,塞尔维亚语","vod_year":"2026","vod_version":"","vod_state":"","vod_author":"","vod_jumpurl":"","vod_tpl":"","vod_tpl_play":"","vod_tpl_down":"","vod_isend":0,"vod_lock":0,"vod_level":0,"vod_copyright":0,"vod_points":0,"vod_points_play":0,"vod_points_down":0,"vod_hits":0,"vod_hits_day":0,"vod_hits_week":0,"vod_hits_month":0,"vod_duration":"105分钟","vod_up":0,"vod_down":0,"vod_score":"0.0","vod_score_all":0,"vod_score_num":0,"vod_time":"2026-08-29 14:28:29","vod_time_add":1787984381,"vod_time_hits":0,"vod_time_make":0,"vod_trysee":0,"vod_douban_id":36898095,"vod_douban_score":"0.0","vod_reurl":"","vod_rel_vod":"","vod_rel_art":"","vod_pwd":"","vod_pwd_url":"","vod_pwd_play":"","vod_pwd_play_url":"","vod_pwd_down":"","vod_pwd_down_url":"","vod_content":"<p>通过一个从南斯拉夫背井离乡到丹麦的年轻女孩的眼睛，我们看到一个家庭在新世界中航行，重建生活，同时保留他们留下的东西。家意味着归属感、牺牲和流离失所所塑造的几代人。Maja六岁时，她的大部分家人从南斯拉夫社会主义联邦共和国搬到丹麦，暂时留下她的两个兄弟，等着跟随其他人去应许之地。事实证明，丹麦远非他们想象中的欢迎天堂。有一种新的语言需要学习，有新的风俗需要驾驭，也有新的天空需要理解。他们真的想留下来吗？Maja在丹麦长大，在那里作为一名艺术家建立了自己的生活和事业，但她不能忘记父母留下的一切。女演员出身的导演Marijana Janković与Maja的年龄相同，当时她的家人离开了Ivangrad（今天的Berane）前往欧洲北部，这只是两者之间最肤浅的相似之处。正如她的两位男主角Ivangradian DejanČukić和Osijek的唯一一位Zlatko Burić肯定知道的那样，Maja或Marijana故事的细节可能是具体的，但更大的事情在几代人和原籍国之间保持不变。<\/p>","vod_play_from":"lzm3u8","vod_play_server":"no","vod_play_note":"","vod_play_url":"HD中字$https:\/\/v.lfthirtytwo.com\/20260829\/9925_0b026585\/index.m3u8","vod_down_from":"http","vod_down_server":"no","vod_down_note":"","vod_down_url":"HD中字$https:\/\/dow.lzdown29.com\/20260829\/9925_0b026585\/家 Hjem (2026).mp4","vod_plot":0,"vod_plot_name":"","vod_plot_detail":"","type_name":"剧情片"},{"vod_id":154720,"type_id":11,"type_id_1":1,"group_id":0,"vod_name":"她的秘密人生","vod_sub":"A Secret Woman \/ The Secret Woman","vod_en":"tademimirensheng","vod_status":1,"vod_letter":"T","vod_color":"","vod_tag":"","vod_class":"剧情","vod_pic":"https:\/\/img1.doubanio.com\/view\/photo\/s_ratio_poster\/public\/p2935272619.webp","vod_pic_thu